  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Entry layer — four entries plus two dispatchers",
      "items": [
        "matlabc_boot.py dispatches: no argument opens the GUI, otherwise ask / flow / analyzer",
        "matlabc_mcp.py spawns the analyzer, ask and flow as stdio subprocesses",
        "The CLI analyzer alone holds 923 statements in main(); the file defines 635 functions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "The kernel and the renderers form a cycle",
      "items": [
        "matlabc.py imports renderers/, and renderers/ imports matlabc.py back",
        "The cycle is hidden behind a module-tail import and is the deepest known structural debt",
        "renderers/assets.py alone is 3825 lines of CSS and JS string constants"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "The AI / Agent layer",
      "items": [
        "ai_cli.py talks to nine vendors and degrades to an offline prompt when none is reachable",
        "agent_loop.py is the controlled self-verifying loop (the strongest module in the repository)",
        "analyzer_memory.py carries learned fixes across runs; patches land through git apply / -R"
      ]
    }
